1
00:00:00,157 --> 00:00:04,007
(Wil:)And then I don't get the job,
and I can never find out why.

2
00:00:05,596 --> 00:00:08,166
(Wil:)Honestly, I get so depressed,
there are entire weeks

3
00:00:08,332 --> 00:00:10,642
(Wil:)that I can't even get out of bed.

4
00:00:13,971 --> 00:00:15,351
(Leonard:)Okay, this was helpful.

5
00:00:19,577 --> 00:00:21,857
(Raj:)Any news on your co-worker
who's in the hospital?

6
00:00:22,013 --> 00:00:24,993
(Bernadette:)Poor thing,
she was in surgery for 18 hours.

7
00:00:25,149 --> 00:00:27,189
(Bernadette:)She's alive, but she's
still in critical condition.

8
00:00:27,351 --> 00:00:28,491
(Raj:)Oh, no.

9
00:00:28,653 --> 00:00:29,993
(Bernadette:)The one bit of good news
is they put her

10
00:00:30,154 --> 00:00:32,194
(Bernadette:)in a medically induced coma
before she read the card.

11
00:00:32,356 --> 00:00:34,426
(Bernadette:)So, you know, silver linings.

12
00:00:38,095 --> 00:00:40,135
(Howard:)Were you like this
when I married you?

13
00:00:43,434 --> 00:00:45,274
(Leonard(on phone):)Don't worry about it, buddy.

14
00:00:45,436 --> 00:00:47,546
(Leonard(on phone):)-Okay, bye.

15
00:00:47,672 --> 00:00:49,272
(Leonard(on phone):)That was Wil,
he's feeling a lot better.

16
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:52,650
(Leonard(on phone):)Apparently, he's 12-down
in the TV Guide crossword puzzle.

17
00:00:54,612 --> 00:00:56,492
(Raj:)Did he help you make a decision
about the movie?

